#EOR (immediate)
1 10 100100 0 i0[11:0] r0[4:0] r1[4:0]               | A64 i 1 64 xor eor r0 r1 i0

# LDR (immediate, 32/64)
10 111 0 01 01 i0[11:0] r1[4:0] r0[4:0]              | A64 i 1 32 r ldr r0 r1 i0
# 11 111 0 00 01 i0[11:0] r1[4:0] r0[4:0]              | A64 i 1 64 r ldr r0 r1 i0
