#ORR (shifted register)
0 01 01010 00 0 r2[4:0] 000000 r1[4:0] r0[4:0]       | A64 i 1 32 or orr r0 r1 r2
#ORR (shifted register)
1 01 01010 00 0 r2[4:0] 000000 r1[4:0] r0[4:0]       | A64 i 1 64 or orr r0 r1 r2

