# C7.2.2 ADD (vector)
# This instruction adds corresponding elements in the two source
# SIMD&FP registers, places the results into a vector, and writes the
# vector to the destination SIMD&FP register.
# ADD <Vd>.<T>, <Vn>.<T>, <Vm>.<T>
# 0 Q 0 01110 sz 1 r2[4:0] 10000 1 r1[4:0] r0[4:0]     | A64 i 1 16 add add r0 r1 r2
